WEBVTT

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:14.990
Then Jesus took John and James and Peter with Him, and went up the hill to pray.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:35.980
While He was praying, His face changed in its appearance, and His clothes became dazzling white.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:43.050
Suddenly two men were talking with Him. They were Moses and Elijah, who appeared in heavenly glory.

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:46.590
You will fulfill God's purpose.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:49.360
You will die in Jerusalem.

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:11.800
As they were leaving, Peter said to Jesus:

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:16.840
Master, how good it is that we are here.

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:19.400
We will make three tents.

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:27.960
As Peter spoke, a cloud came and overshadowed them and the disciples were afraid.

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:35.900
And a voice came from the cloud saying, "This is My Son, the Chosen One. Listen to Him".

